---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const updated = '18 November 2026';
---

<Base title="Privacy · Belal Zaky" description="What this website collects, which is very little.">
  <main class="sheet">
    <section class="wrap page-head">
      <p class="label">privacy</p>
      <h1 class="page-h1">What this site collects</h1>
      <p class="page-meta">updated {updated}</p>
    </section>
    <section class="wrap sect prose" style="padding-top:0">
      <p>This is my personal website. There are no accounts, forms or cookies, and no advertising.</p>
      <p>The site counts visits with Vercel Web Analytics, which records the page, the referring site, and the country and device type of each visit, without cookies and without identifying you. I use it to see which pages people read.</p>
      <p>If you switch between light and dark mode, your browser remembers that choice on your own device. It isn't sent anywhere.</p>
      <p>If you email me, I use your address only to reply. Questions about any of this go to <a href="mailto:hello@belalzaky.uk">hello@belalzaky.uk</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
